<title>ESTONIA: UHISPANK TO SIGN SEESAN BUY DEAL.</title>
<headline>UHISPANK TO SIGN SEESAN BUY DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uhispank said on Monday that it would sign later this week an agreement to buy 40 percent of the Seesan-Elu insurance company.</p>
<p>Uhispank vice-president Janek Maggi told a news conference that the deal would be signed on Thursday.</p>
<p>Maggi was confirming a report last week in newspaper Aripaev on the Seesan deal.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400</p>
</text>
